    63	#   - the shared stack strip is reserved away from input placements so the input visibly differs
    64	#     from the output and so generator validation is stable
    65	#
    66	# e) visual_observability:
    67	#   - across examples, the distinctive change is easy to see: scattered objects become a vertical
    68	#     column on the left
    69	#   - scale is preserved, so large objects remain large inside the stack
    70	#   - prototype swapping is still visible because the two families keep different internal colors
