    85	#     top-left corner differs from the corresponding input sprite top-left corner
    86	#   - the intended distribution is all components moved in every generated sample
    87	#
    88	# i) new_main_assumptions_to_check:
    89	#   - reading-order sorting assumes bbox top-lefts are well-defined and distinct; generator ensures
    90	#     sprites do not overlap so ties do not occur
    91	#   - stacked output assumes the total required height fits in the canvas; generator enforces this
    92	#   - prototype matching still assumes every sprite is an exact scaled prototype instance
